OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies in two-car crash on
OL,4,AA94 in Angus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old man has died in a two-car
OL,7,Fcrash in Angus.
OL,9,FHe was driving a white Audi A1 that was
OL,10,Fin collision with a dark-coloured Ford
OL,11,FFocus on the A94 near Glamis at about
OL,12,F18:05 on Thursday.
OL,14,FPolice said the 22-year-old male driver
OL,15,Fof the Ford Focus was taken to hospital
OL,16,Fwhere his condition was described as
OL,17,F"serious".
OL,19,FThe road between Glamis and Meigle, in
OL,20,FPerth and Kinross, was closed to allow
OL,21,Ffor a crash investigation.
